Z||000011||SCCA FIERO||06-17-99||10:03 PM||||Cooter, this is not my car. I just saw it on the web and thought i would show it to everyone. It is very impressive,isn't it?<p>I think the "extra poundage" you mean is the larger rotors and calipers? If that is what you are talking about, I don't think the added poundage(maybe 20 pounds)of the rotors and calipers will even be noticed. I am wondering if the added leverage would cause unintended lock-up.
